[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://unithdr2d"]

; The root viewport's `rendering/viewport/hdr_2d`, from this project's project.godot. The root draws
; its canvas in linear half floats and converts to sRGB at the copy to the screen, so every other
; golden (hdr_2d off) differs from it. Left: a red square of alpha 0.5 over a green one. Middle: a
; 0.5 gray square at modulate 1.5. Right: a square at modulate 4, which clamps at the copy. The
; clear colour is Godot's default, 0.3 gray, which converts to linear as well.

